As an OS implementer I regularly find myself coming across Itanium
issues which aren't really relevant to the IA-64 lists that I'm
currently on, including this one, because they're not specific to any
particular operating system.  Examples could include processor
implementations (and optimising for them), chipsets, firmware, and
general OS issues related to Itanium features.

I was wondering if anyone else would be interested if I created such a
list (or whether there already exists something appropriate)?

